   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "# Posters and signs with words, for your room\n**VTube Pro workflow, 8 GB graphics card** (SDXL). Pack 2026.10.01.\n\nWall posters, shop signs, menu boards and banners with readable words.\n\n## How to use it\n1. Write the words in quotes inside \"Your prompt\", like the title \"LATE NIGHT RAMEN\".\n2. Press Run. Small: add the words in any editor afterwards.\n3. Find the result in ComfyUI's **output/VTubePro** folder (or right-click the picture > Save Image).\n\nThe **green boxes** are the ones to change.\n\n**You get:** 1024x2048 PNG (portrait poster). Power-of-two, so it works as a texture.\n\n**In VTube Pro:** Put it on a poster or sign in your room (Blender), or use it as the in-room screen picture.\n\n**Settings:** 704x1408, 28 steps, CFG 6, Real-ESRGAN to 1024x2048. SDXL can't write: add the words yourself.\n\n## Models (all allow commercial use)\n- [sd_xl_base_1.0.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-xl-base-1.0) (6.9 GB) in `models/checkpoints`: CreativeML Open RAIL++-M\n- [RealESRGAN_x4plus.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Real-ESRGAN_repackaged) (0.1 GB) in `models/upscale_models`: BSD-3-Clause\n\nMissing a model? ComfyUI offers to download it when you open this workflow. Or ask your AI: \n*\"Set up the VTube Pro poster workflow in ComfyUI\"*: the VTube Pro Helper downloads every file from its official page, checks it, and adds this workflow, after you say yes.\n\n## Tips\n- No real brands or logos: make your own designs.\n- Short titles come out best (2-4 words).\n- Make pictures when you are not live: picture AI slows face tracking."
   ],
   "title": "Start here",
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
